{
  "day": 1,
  "title": "Day 1: Talking about my job — SpeakSprint",
  "heading": "Talking about my job",
  "kicker": "DAY 01 · 30 MINUTES · 6 SESSIONS / WEEK",
  "description": "Nói về vai trò, đội nhóm và trách nhiệm chính.",
  "contentVersion": 2,
  "answers": {
    "comp": "a|b|a",
    "quiz": "a|b"
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "mission",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">MISSION · 1 MIN</span><h2>Today's mission</h2><p>Introduce yourself: your role, team, and two responsibilities. Speak for <b>30–60 seconds</b>, using at least <b>3 of today’s 5 chunks</b>. Say it first; write only brief notes.</p><p class=\"instruction\">5 chunk mỗi ngày · tối đa 5 chunk mới. Ngày tổng kết ôn lại chunk đã học.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "weekly-baseline",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">BEFORE PRACTICE · 1 MIN</span><p class=\"instruction\">Làm bài nói đầu tuần trước khi đọc bài và xem ví dụ. Ghi lại những gì bạn tự nói được.</p><div class=\"weekly-check\"><h3>Weekly baseline</h3><p>Repeat this same 60-second task at the beginning and end of the week: <b>Introduce your role, team, and main responsibility.</b></p><p class=\"instruction\">Làm riêng với bài nói chính nếu thời lượng khác. Tự đếm số lần dừng lâu hơn 3 giây; không suy ra độ chính xác từ thời lượng.</p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\">Actual baseline speaking seconds:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\">Pauses longer than 3 seconds:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\">Target chunks used (0–5):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\">Chunks recalled without help (0–5):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\">A recurring error to work on:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\"><p id=\"weekly-comparison\" role=\"status\"></p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "warmup",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Warm-up recall</h2><p>Say your job, your team, and one task aloud. Use any English you already know. This is a starting point, not a test.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "reading",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">Hi, I'm Mai. I work as a software developer at a logistics company. I'm part of the product team. My main responsibility is building tools that help drivers plan their routes. I mainly work with four engineers and a product manager. I help our team solve customer problems. Most mornings, we talk about what needs to be done. Today, we need to make a page easier to use. I like seeing how a small change can make someone's work easier. What about you? What do you do?</div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "comprehension",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "assessment",
      "prefix": "comp",
      "label": "COMPREHENSION · 3 MIN",
      "heading": "Check the message",
      "hint": "Look for who, what happened, and why the speaker says it.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "prompt": "1. Why is Mai speaking?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": " To introduce her work",
              "name": "comp-1",
              "value": "a",
              "saveKey": "v2-comp1"
            },
            {
              "text": " To report a broken tool",
              "name": "comp-1",
              "value": "b",
              "saveKey": "v2-comp1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "prompt": "2. Who does Mai mainly work with?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": " Drivers and a sales manager",
              "name": "comp-2",
              "value": "a",
              "saveKey": "v2-comp2"
            },
            {
              "text": " Engineers and a product manager",
              "name": "comp-2",
              "value": "b",
              "saveKey": "v2-comp2"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "prompt": "3. Why does Mai ask what you do?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": " To continue the conversation",
              "name": "comp-3",
              "value": "a",
              "saveKey": "v2-comp3"
            },
            {
              "text": " To assign you a task",
              "name": "comp-3",
              "value": "b",
              "saveKey": "v2-comp3"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "chunks",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "chunks",
      "label": "CHUNKS · 5 MIN",
      "heading": "Five chunks to use today",
      "instruction": "Learn the whole phrase. Change the details to fit your work. Mở từng thẻ khi cần; sau đó nhìn đi chỗ khác và nói lại.",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "1/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "I work as a…",
          "meaning": "Tôi làm nghề…",
          "details": [
            "Introduce your job to a new colleague.",
            "I work as a/an + job",
            "I work as a developer.",
            "I work as a developer on a small product team."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-1"
        },
        {
          "label": "2/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "I'm part of the… team",
          "meaning": "Tôi thuộc nhóm…",
          "details": [
            "Tell someone which team you belong to.",
            "I'm part of the + team name + team",
            "I'm part of the support team.",
            "I'm part of the mobile team at my company."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-2"
        },
        {
          "label": "3/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "My main responsibility is…",
          "meaning": "Trách nhiệm chính của tôi là…",
          "details": [
            "Explain the main thing you are responsible for.",
            "My main responsibility is + verb-ing",
            "My main responsibility is testing the app.",
            "My main responsibility is helping customers use our app."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-3"
        },
        {
          "label": "4/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "I mainly work with…",
          "meaning": "Tôi chủ yếu làm việc với…",
          "details": [
            "Name the people you work with most.",
            "I mainly work with + people",
            "I mainly work with designers.",
            "I mainly work with two developers and a tester."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-4"
        },
        {
          "label": "5/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "I help our team…",
          "meaning": "Tôi giúp nhóm…",
          "details": [
            "Explain how you contribute to the team.",
            "I help our team + base verb",
            "I help our team solve problems.",
            "I help our team release useful features."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "variation",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">VARIATION · 4 MIN</span><h2>Change it, then make it yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Say each answer first, then type a short sentence. Two quick variations per chunk; keep the same pattern.</p><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>1. I work as a…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\">A. Use this idea: a support agent.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>2. I'm part of the… team</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\">A. Use this idea: the design team.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>3. My main responsibility is…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\">A. Use this idea: answering customer questions.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>4. I mainly work with…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\">A. Use this idea: the support team.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>5. I help our team…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\">A. Use this idea: finish tasks on time.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\"></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "rapid-recall",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">RAPID RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Recall in about three seconds</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Look away from the chunk cards. Try to start speaking within 3 seconds, then type what you said. A model appears only after an attempt; other natural answers are possible.</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Introduce your job to a new colleague. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I work as a developer on a small product team.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Tell someone which team you belong to. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I'm part of the mobile team at my company.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Explain the main thing you are responsible for. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"My main responsibility is helping customers use our app.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Name the people you work with most. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I mainly work with two developers and a tester.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Explain how you contribute to the team. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I help our team release useful features.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "speaking",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">SPEAK · 5 MIN</span><h2>Make the language yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read aloud three times. Follow the pauses marked by / and emphasize the important words.</p><div class=\"shadow\">I work as a developer. /<br>I'm part of the support team. /<br>My main responsibility is testing the app.</div><p><b>Speaking challenge:</b> Introduce yourself: your role, team, and two responsibilities.</p><p class=\"instruction\">Speak for 30–60 seconds. Use at least 3 chunks. Notes only: your situation · two details · a reason or problem · your next step. Do not write a full script first.</p><textarea id=\"speaking-response\" data-save=\"speaking\" placeholder=\"Nói thành tiếng trước, rồi nhập lại ít nhất 8 từ bạn đã nói…\"></textarea><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"speaking-done\">Tôi đã nói thành tiếng</button><span id=\"status-speaking\">Chưa hoàn thành</span></div><div id=\"speak-feedback\" class=\"feedback\"></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "conversation",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">CONVERSATION · 3 MIN</span><h2>A real work conversation</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Practise with a partner, or take both roles aloud. Your partner is a coworker. Open one question, answer it, then continue. Khi luyện cùng Codex, yêu cầu đóng vai đồng nghiệp và hỏi từng câu; trang này không có AI trò chuyện trực tiếp.</p><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 1</summary><p>What do you do in your team?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 2</summary><p>What are you working on now?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 3</summary><p>What is difficult about it?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 4</summary><p>What will you do next?</p></details><p class=\"instruction\">After 4 exchanges, choose at most 3 useful corrections. Say the improved sentences once more.</p>"
    },
